# EF Training — cohesion + layout mix

All **Direction EF** Training interiors (`direction-ef/training/*`) share **chrome and tokens** with About, not identical section stacks. Overlay section **02 TRAINING**.

**Canonical page playbook:** [.cursor/skills/odd-ritual-pages/SKILL.md](../skills/odd-ritual-pages/SKILL.md)  
Wireframe: [docs/wireframes/training-direction-ef.md](../../docs/wireframes/training-direction-ef.md)

## Shared chrome (required)

| Layer | Component / pattern |
|-------|---------------------|
| Page wrapper | `LookbookAboutPageShell` + `SiteIndexFooter` |
| Opener | `LookbookPageOpener` |
| Motion | `LookbookScrollReveal`, `LookbookStaggerBody`, `LOOKBOOK_EASE` |
| Tokens | `#FFFFFF` · `#F3EEE7` · `#181818` · `#5C5C5C` · Apply `#0A3C2E` on CTAs only |
| Scroll | No `snap-y` on EF Training routes in `App.tsx` |
| Copy | `src/data/training-copy.ts` |

## Shared design rules

1. **Hairline separation** — `border-b border-neutral-200/60` between sections; schedule/index rows use `border-t`.
2. **No card chrome** — no bordered/shadowed boxes.
3. **No Buy / Reserve / Book / Sign up for classes** Triib chrome — class pages use **Free Trial Class** → `/start-here/experience` and Apply → `/start-here/apply`; PT uses mailto `training@`.
4. **Schedule** = editorial **week strip** (Mon–Sun columns, hairline time plates) — not Triib embed, not SaaS calendar apps.
5. Do **not** use `DirectionEPageShell` or mutate frozen `direction-e/**`.
6. Homepage remains frozen — see [direction-ef-home-frozen.mdc](direction-ef-home-frozen.mdc).

## Layout mix matrix

| Page | Recipe |
|------|--------|
| **Build** | Opener + photo/editorial split + body + week-strip schedule + next → Burn |
| **Burn** | Same DNA, alternate canvas/photo; week-strip schedule; next → Balance |
| **Balance** | Sparse coming-soon; no schedule; no fake CTA |
| **1-on-1** | Story-led PT + Team cue + inquire / Start Here |
| **Small Group** | Format as ruled index (about-us-13 DNA) |
| **Private Group** | Inquiry-forward band (cta-08 DNA, Apply green only); no prices |

## Catalog DNA (adapt, don’t CLI-install)

`services-03` easing · `about-us-13` ruled index · `cta-08` image statement (strip Book)
